# ⚠ CAPTURES STAY IGNORED BY DEFAULT, AND THE DEFAULT IS THE SAFE ONE.  A
# recording carries the sensor's MAC and serial unless the harness redacted
# them (api-request §2.13), so an ad-hoc capture taken at the repo root must
# never be committed by accident.  The fixtures below are tracked one by one,
# after checking each is redacted — see tests/fixtures/README.md.
*.hmwire
!tests/fixtures/*.hmwire
__pycache__/

# Claude-specific artefacts stay local, as in PinPoint Studio's tree: notes and
# skills are working material rather than a contract, and settings.local.json is
# per-machine permission state that means nothing to anyone else.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
